the knowledge base r3_6_at_least_three_criteria includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/at-least-three-criteria.ruml".

child 1 of Mindestens drei Merkmale erfüllt counts for a case if
    Merkmal 1 holds for the case.

child 2 of Mindestens drei Merkmale erfüllt counts for a case if
    Merkmal 2 holds for the case.

child 3 of Mindestens drei Merkmale erfüllt counts for a case if
    Merkmal 3 holds for the case.

child 4 of Mindestens drei Merkmale erfüllt counts for a case if
    Merkmal 4 holds for the case.

child 5 of Mindestens drei Merkmale erfüllt counts for a case if
    Merkmal 5 holds for the case.

% Mindestens drei der fünf Merkmale müssen erfüllt sein
Mindestens drei Merkmale erfüllt holds for a case if
    Mindestens drei Merkmale erfüllt is decided for the case
    and a number M is the count of each N such that
        child a number N of Mindestens drei Merkmale erfüllt counts for the case
    and M >= 3.

Mindestens drei Merkmale erfüllt holds for a case if
    it is not the case that Mindestens drei Merkmale erfüllt is decided for the case
    and Mindestens drei Merkmale erfüllt would hold for the case.

Mindestens drei Merkmale erfüllt is decided for a case if
    Merkmal 1 is decided for the case
    and Merkmal 2 is decided for the case
    and Merkmal 3 is decided for the case
    and Merkmal 4 is decided for the case
    and Merkmal 5 is decided for the case.

